# Media Hub operations

See `docs/DEV-WORKFLOW.md` for daily dev + push flow. Use **`/push`** or say **push** for guided deploy with options.

## Production (Vercel — primary)

- URL: https://media.emmyzettergren.se
- Auto-deploy from `main` via `vercel.json`
- Health: `/api/healthz`
- Env (Vercel dashboard): `DATABASE_URL` (Neon pooled), `TMDB_API_KEY`, `NODE_ENV=production`, `BASE_PATH=/`

## Local secrets

`artifacts/api-server/.env` — **dev Neon only**. Never use prod `DATABASE_URL` locally.

## Key commands

```powershell
corepack pnpm --filter @workspace/api-server run build
corepack pnpm --filter @workspace/api-spec run codegen
corepack pnpm --filter @workspace/db run push
corepack pnpm run typecheck
$env:PORT="5174"; $env:BASE_PATH="/"; corepack pnpm --filter @workspace/media-tracker run dev
```

Frontend port **5174**, API **5000**.
